<title>UK: TABLE-Anglian Water year profits higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Anglian Water year profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) (pre-excep) 86.8		  vs  78.1</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 68.6		  vs  78.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  24.3		  vs   n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  34.5		  vs  30.0</p>
<p> Pretax pre-excepts     257.0		  vs 238.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     208.0		  vs 238.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   837.1		  vs 775.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said a restructuring provision in Anglian Water Services of 20 million stg will realise savings of 10 million stg per year. The other exceptional charges are -- a 2.0 million stg funding of the Anglian Water Trust and an 18.8 million provision following a review of Anglian Water International. Profits and earnings figures after exceptional charges includes 8.2 million stg loss on disposal of businesses.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 242 and 260 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Anglian Water Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
